# A minimal, hand-written OBJ triangle — not `flutter3d_samples`'s fixtures,
# on purpose: that package declares `flutter: sdk: flutter` for its own
# `flutter.assets:` entry, and a dev_dependency on it would put the Flutter
# SDK back on `flutter3d_build`'s own dependency graph, which is exactly the
# thing `flatDartPackages` exists to catch (see `tool/structure/repository.dart`).
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
f 1 2 3
